{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0012_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0012_story_intro_title", "source_sha256": "868310e193d1af0b9a0a16b18d5826a5490fe3f9410defa30dc115829fc1db4a", "ja": "なし", "zh": "无", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0012_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0012_story_intro_synopsis", "source_sha256": "868310e193d1af0b9a0a16b18d5826a5490fe3f9410defa30dc115829fc1db4a", "ja": "なし", "zh": "无", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0012_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0012_story_intro_1000_102mis", "source_sha256": "11d18b63069800d676e87eb2fd91e06b3a5db2095eb8f7f8a9966e50ff62ac6e", "ja": "あ、いました！\n{$P$}さん！", "zh": "啊，来了！\n{$P$}先生！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0012_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0012_story_intro_1001_p", "source_sha256": "f03bf040351988f33415364d34a25959a04470e8d658c9521457b2f0c9317be3", "ja": "お疲れさまです、青羽さん。\n俺に何か？", "zh": "辛苦了，青羽小姐。\n找我什么事呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0012_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0012_story_intro_1002_102mis", "source_sha256": "0b1427fa3829a89061f0d70d7bb05fcab3bbeab13d6bb55813f9c41fb6031297", "ja": "はい！　社長さんが、{$P$}さんに\nお話ししたいことがあるそうなんです。", "zh": "是的！社长似乎有事\n想和{$P$}先生谈。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0012_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0012_story_intro_1003_p", "source_sha256": "39a93fec8484075331239e7bbeef7d7c6046a159b6a4afd8c3eaac7fb28bae27", "ja": "そうですか……なんだろう？\nありがとうございます、ちょっと行ってきますね！", "zh": "这样啊……是什么事呢？\n谢谢你，那我就过去一趟了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0012_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0012_story_intro_1004_102mis", "source_sha256": "51fefca77c44db7cd03fc92fa964caec2cbbe713d7c2bd75bae114d4965b914a", "ja": "はい！　{$P$}さん、\n頑張ってくださいねっ！", "zh": "好的！{$P$}先生，\n请加油喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0012_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0012_story_intro_1005_null", "source_sha256": "efc1d82f27c00c2cd66242ba3968b75b5084f0ad635f478df59f2ea4ca40369e", "ja": "そして……", "zh": "然后……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0012_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0012_story_intro_1006_101kot", "source_sha256": "b3bd1ab7919c4fb1c0ac88c7643d7f84988a446dfe5fd6003d57af9c9965a7d8", "ja": "お疲れさまです！　{$P$}さん。\n日々のお仕事ぶり、美咲ちゃんから聞いてますよ！", "zh": "辛苦了，{$P$}先生！\n我有听美咲说你平常工作多么认真喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0012_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0012_story_intro_1007_101kot", "source_sha256": "4ebf98a8f81eb3711134c5cc7253a87c64b0d930b71808159f2367b4f59447ee", "ja": "前回のユニットは絶好調、劇場公演は、日を追うごとに\n盛り上がってきているとか……さすがですね♪", "zh": "上次的团体状态绝佳，剧场公演的气氛\n也一场比一场热烈……真不愧是制作人♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0012_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0012_story_intro_1008_p", "source_sha256": "7e7a18455583d122db693e22ef30b5c6f99ccc5648a67c3f42c8438245c35c53", "ja": "アイドルのみんなが、頑張ってくれているおかげです。\n今日呼び出されたのも、もしかして……？", "zh": "这是多亏了各位偶像的努力。\n今天找我过来，该不会也是……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0012_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0012_story_intro_1009_president", "source_sha256": "e1f20d1494eaaabc1b4da7effe653d37d39fb0a74d5669d5634a9b19a122a5ff", "ja": "フフフ、さすがの察しの良さだね！\nそれでこそ、我が765プロのプロデューサーだよ！", "zh": "呵呵呵，你还真是敏锐呢！\n我们765艺能的制作人就要这样啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0012_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0012_story_intro_1010_p", "source_sha256": "330e1cc3fd54daa6ee6208a775067739bb9f5c66a020b1287b2c6ccd5d4485bc", "ja": "社長、お疲れさまです！", "zh": "社长，您辛苦了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0012_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0012_story_intro_1011_president", "source_sha256": "031a244ea6d70cca5264fd97c6a8dd8ccfae68e7ab635fa31a9644934e515a4f", "ja": "さて、君が予想している通り……今回、また新たな\nアイドルユニットを結成したいと考えているのだよ。", "zh": "好了，正如你所猜测的……\n这次我打算再组一个新的偶像团体。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0012_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0012_story_intro_1012_p", "source_sha256": "ba8e9c5cb1adccd947fcb92a268dbc199800481593d2685f67fde8e6bb9b113f", "ja": "新しいユニットですか。\nメンバーは、もう決まっているんですか？", "zh": "新的团体啊，\n请问成员已经决定了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0012_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0012_story_intro_1013_president", "source_sha256": "5c24cd78f2c251c562327dcf64524b506477c54c6a7134a187f8e49c815cb75b", "ja": "うむ！　メンバーは、百瀬莉緒君、島原エレナ君、\n篠宮可憐君、四条貴音君、伴田路子君……。", "zh": "嗯！成员有百濑莉绪、岛原艾琳娜、\n筿宫可怜、四条贵音和伴田路子……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0012_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0012_story_intro_1014_president", "source_sha256": "2738faceb609825d14e9d41518623a274f761e10b35851c826dbc9114e2549a0", "ja": "この5人からなる、個性的でアクロバティックな\nユニットの名は……『ARRIVE』だ！", "zh": "由以上五个人所组成，充满个性又令人惊奇的团体，\n名字就叫……『ARRIVE』！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0012_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0012_story_intro_1015_101kot", "source_sha256": "e4ddb58d0ba195b49ab502e9605b7258822441588386b3741ddc81a388aab27e", "ja": "個性と個性がぶつかった先にどこにたどり着くのか……\nそれを見てみたい、って意味がこめられてるそうです♪", "zh": "社长想见识看看，相互冲突的个性与个性\n最后将抵达何方……团名似乎有这层意思♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0012_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0012_story_intro_1016_president", "source_sha256": "becf7b20974b2c4a3ad9c720a39ab06617bcc9e1a62e714c2a0971623473222b", "ja": "個性も実力も兼ね備えたメンバーだからね。\nこれは、前代未聞のユニットになるはずだよ、君！", "zh": "毕竟成员各个兼具个性和实力呢。\n这一定会成为一个前所未有的团体啊，你说呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0012_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0012_story_intro_1017_p", "source_sha256": "3a1766176cdc07624119a15453160a473ebb6d0289a30fd018a3235ebd12fc50", "ja": "なるほど。しかし、このメンバーだと……\nリーダーを誰にするかが、少し悩みどころですね。", "zh": "原来如此，但这些成员……\n会让人有些烦恼队长的人选呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0012_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0012_story_intro_1018_president", "source_sha256": "2cbbbc0436b536c74fb472de18bc939cd37e402c286c75468b63291654136c1c", "ja": "それなら、もう決まっている。\nリーダーはズバリ……篠宮可憐君だ！", "zh": "关于这个，我已经决定了。\n队长正是……筿宫可怜！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0012_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0012_story_intro_1019_p", "source_sha256": "4029568d5762504d543c9a52a46af78efdf9994635413e1a0066ee2d8f7f5713", "ja": "か、可憐ですか？　確かに、実力はありますが……\n性格に臆病なところがあるので、不安なような……？", "zh": "可、可怜吗？她的确是有实力……\n但个性上有些怯懦，好像让人不太放心……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0012_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0012_story_intro_1020_president", "source_sha256": "35507a44e13ab1a94431e3bc47dd781d0473373363c2c78ae02574831d05401d", "ja": "確かに、最初からうまくいくかはわからないが……\n可憐君なら、きっと乗り越えてくれるだろう。", "zh": "确实不知道能不能一开始就很顺利……\n但可怜一定能够克服难关的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0012_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0012_story_intro_1021_president", "source_sha256": "210ceb81f22b85e4f4d9372568904521482ce5ae5ea65e00da6fee2fad9a7d3e", "ja": "彼女には仲間がいる。そして何より、プロデューサーの\n君がいる！　みんなのフォロー、期待しているよ！", "zh": "她拥有伙伴，更重要的是有你这个制作人在！\n我很期待你对大家的协助！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0012_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0012_story_intro_1022", "source_sha256": "59c55d4b878df63d50ff372587f8319ae3821c1cf3fe8c6bce31cf184b4a7c34", "ja": "わかりました！", "zh": "我知道了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0012_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0012_story_intro_2000_p", "source_sha256": "9adcc57fda3d7f20411ffeb77b040f8ef9cb55d0af6c25096213b84030db23fa", "ja": "社長……わかりました！　プロデューサーとして可憐と\nメンバーを支えて、必ず公演を成功させてみせます！", "zh": "社长……我知道了！我会以制作人的身份辅助\n可怜和其他成员，一定会让公演成功的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0012_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0012_story_intro_2001_president", "source_sha256": "7de1b683443c8ec92bff66ee3b67b04e1e856e34574c74cdc464ab6f0ddbf319", "ja": "うむ。素晴らしい返事だ！\n今回も期待しているよ！", "zh": "嗯，回答得很好！\n这次我也很期待喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0012_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0012_story_intro_2002_101kot", "source_sha256": "0cdc0b19a1cda3957a06bdfcf987c6ac2e3c6ed8a54dfe5ad1e67f94f24dc8a5", "ja": "{$P$}さんなら、きっと大丈夫！\n私も、陰ながら応援していますね♪", "zh": "{$P$}先生一定可以的！\n我也会默默为你们加油的♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0012_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0012_story_intro_2003_p", "source_sha256": "15bac7d47b06ff8a7714b23234306bf040f2c2ee6ac8cbb68436b831164fc577", "ja": "はい！　ありがとうございます！", "zh": "好的！谢谢你！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0012_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0012_story_intro_2004_p", "source_sha256": "64360f717e927eca54b1e6e91103775005f919e1f37ff2bdb083509812750924", "ja": "（可憐がリーダーか……。少し心配だが、メンバーを\nまとめる経験は、可憐自身の成長に繫がるだろう）", "zh": "（可怜是队长啊……虽然有点担心，但让团员\n团结一心的经验，一定也能让可怜有所成长吧。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0012_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0012_story_intro_2005_p", "source_sha256": "76db9dd4b6120f657e3599e1843888351be66b01c22313e2f4004e91de7c2faa", "ja": "（ARRIVE。どんなユニットになるか、\nプロデュースするのが楽しみだ！）", "zh": "（『ARRIVE』会成为什么样的团体呢？\n真期待培育她们呢！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
